<title>POLAND: OKOCIM OCT NET JUMPS TO PLN 2.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>OKOCIM OCT NET JUMPS TO PLN 2.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.84 vs   0.91</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.20 vs   1.64</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.86 vs   2.16</p>
<p> Sales		   17.34 vs  11.53</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    24.42 vs  13.14</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	45.58 vs  26.32</p>
<p> Operating profit    39.21 vs  33.81</p>
<p> Sales		  187.98 vs 138.74</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish brewer is Okocimskie</p>
<p>Zakoady Piwowarskie SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
